    "text": "Bulletin No: 01 MHA/2026/05/26/01 COLOR: Amber Advisory for High Waves and Strong Winds. Issued by the Natural Hazards Early Warning Centre Issued at 04.30 p.m. 26 May 2026 For the period from 04.30 p.m. 26 May 2026 to 04.30 p.m. 27 May 2026.",
