      75.38,
      240.65,
      523.54,
      256.61
    ],
    "text": "For the sea areas extending from Kalpitiya to Pottuvil via Colombo,",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      15.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      260.09,
      526.13,
      421.13
    ],
    "text": "Galle and Hambantota. PLEASE BE PREPARED! The sea areas extending from Kankasanthurai to Chilaw via Mannar and from Matara to Pottuvil via Hambantota will be rough at times with strong gusty winds up to 60 kmph. The swell waves (about 2.0 m \u2013 3.0 m) height (This is not for land area) and wave period (about 10s-14s) may increase in the sea areas off the coast extending from Kalpitiya to Pottuvil via Colombo, Galle, and Hambantota.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.960000038146973,
      12.0,
      14.039999961853027,
      15.960000038146973,
      21.959999084472656
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      437.93,
      525.9,
      466.73
    ],
    "text": "There is a possibility that near shore sea areas off the coast extending from Kalpitiya to Matara via Colombo and Galle, may experience surges due to swell waves.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      483.67,
      525.96,
      512.47
    ],
    "text": "The sea areas off the coast extending from Kalpitiya to Pottuvil via Colombo, Galle and Hambantota can be rough at times.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      529.27,
      525.47,
      570.67
    ],
    "text": "The naval and fishing communities who are engaged in fishing and naval activities in the above sea areas are requested to be vigilant in this regard.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
